    "Deletes cached voice audio only. Your talks, drills, words and books are untouched. Every line synthesizes again the next time it plays, which costs credits.": {
      "comment": "Message in an alert shown in the Developer section, explaining that clearing the audio cache only deletes cached audio files, and does not affect the actual audio used in the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Deleting your account permanently removes your voice clone, credits, and account data. Practice data on this device is erased too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Löschen des Kontos verschwinden Stimmklon, Credits und Kontodaten endgültig. Die Lerndaten auf diesem Gerät werden ebenfalls gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "계정을 삭제하면 음성 클론, 크레딧, 계정 데이터가 영구히 사라져요. 이 기기의 학습 데이터도 함께 지워집니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
