    "Discover and use words you don't reach for yet — Practice → Vocabulary highlights the ones at and above your level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entdecke Wörter, zu denen du noch nicht greifst — unter Practice → Vocabulary sind die auf und über deinem Niveau markiert."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 안 쓰는 단어를 찾아 써 보세요. Practice → Vocabulary에서 내 레벨 이상인 단어를 표시해 줍니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distinct graded words you've used, accumulating from the day each was first said.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
