        }
      }
    },
    "Instead of a reminder, your fluent self phones you once a day with a question to answer out loud.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statt einer Erinnerung ruft dich dein fließendes Ich einmal am Tag an – mit einer Frage, die du laut beantwortest."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "알림 대신, 유창해진 내가 하루에 한 번 전화를 걸어 소리 내어 답할 질문을 남깁니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instead of a reminder, your fluent self phones you once a day with a question to answer out loud. They remember how the last call went.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statt einer Erinnerung ruft dich dein fließendes Ich einmal am Tag an – mit einer Frage, die du laut beantwortest. Es erinnert sich, wie das letzte Gespräch lief."
