    "Serious about this": {},
    "Sets how your future self speaks and how scenes are written. Your measured level in Progress is unaffected until the next assessment, which will overwrite this with what your talks show.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Legt fest, wie dein fließendes Ich spricht und wie Szenen geschrieben werden. Dein gemessenes Niveau unter Progress bleibt bis zur nächsten Einstufung unberührt — die überschreibt diesen Wert dann mit dem, was deine Gespräche zeigen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "미래의 내가 어떻게 말할지, 장면이 어떻게 쓰일지를 정해요. Progress에서 측정된 레벨은 다음 평가 전까지 영향을 받지 않고, 그 평가 때 실제 대화가 보여준 값으로 덮어씁니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Setting the scene…": {
