    "So — how did the interview go yesterday?": {},
    "Something specific coming up with them — a talk you're dreading, news you have to break.": {
      "comment": "Tooltip text for the \"Make a situation\" button on the FindPersonCard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwas Konkretes, das mit ihnen ansteht — ein Gespräch, vor dem dir graut, eine Nachricht, die du überbringen musst."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "그 사람과 앞두고 있는 구체적인 일 — 꺼내기 어려운 이야기, 전해야 하는 소식."
          }
        }
      }
    },
