    "Vocabulary is graded from the words you actually use; ≈ levels are read from your pace, grammar score and turn length.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Wortschatz wird aus den Wörtern eingestuft, die du wirklich verwendest; ≈-Niveaus werden aus Tempo, Grammatiknote und Beitragslänge gelesen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "어휘는 실제로 쓴 단어로 등급을 매기고, ≈ 레벨은 말하는 속도·문법 점수·발화 길이에서 읽어낸 값이에요."
